From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: clk: sunxi-ng: h616: Add the G2D bus reset

The H616 CCU already models the G2D module, bus and MBUS clocks but not
the reset in bit 16 of the G2D bus gating reset register (H616 user
manual v1.0, 3.3.5.56, G2D_BGR_REG at 0x063c). Add it after the last
reset so the existing indices stay unchanged.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---

--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun50i-h616.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun50i-h616.c
@@ -1115,6 +1115,7 @@
 	[RST_BUS_TCON_TV0]	= { 0xb9c, BIT(16) },
 	[RST_BUS_TCON_TV1]	= { 0xb9c, BIT(17) },
 	[RST_BUS_LVDS]		= { 0xbac, BIT(16) },
+	[RST_BUS_G2D]		= { 0x63c, BIT(16) },
 	[RST_BUS_TVE_TOP]	= { 0xbbc, BIT(16) },
 	[RST_BUS_TVE0]		= { 0xbbc, BIT(17) },
 	[RST_BUS_HDCP]		= { 0xc4c, BIT(16) },
--- a/include/dt-bindings/reset/sun50i-h616-ccu.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/reset/sun50i-h616-ccu.h
@@ -70,5 +70,6 @@
 #define RST_BUS_TCON_LCD0	61
 #define RST_BUS_TCON_LCD1	62
 #define RST_BUS_LVDS		63
+#define RST_BUS_G2D		64
 
 #endif /* _DT_BINDINGS_RESET_SUN50I_H616_H_ */
